<title>NETHERLANDS: AXXICON 1996 PROFIT 6.1 MLN GUILDERS.</title>
<headline>AXXICON 1996 PROFIT 6.1 MLN GUILDERS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     2.71 vs   2.28</p>
<p>    Net profit			     6.14 vs   4.68</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  0.80 vs   0.65</p>
<p>    Turnover				   90 vs     93</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     9.94 vs   8.55</p>
<p>    Interest charges		     1.07 vs   1.25</p>
<p>    Tax					2.73 vs   2.61</p>
<p>Note - Industrial moulds maker Axxicon said that based on</p>
<p>expected developments in the market and its market position, it</p>
<p>expects slightly higher turnover and net profit in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
